    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L02-ACTIVITY-010",
      "SourceSection": "2.2: Climbing Cost",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Jada thinks that the college tuition will increase by 40% each decade. Do you agree with Jada? Explain your reasoning.",
